summary: DAST test for the tang operator
description: |
    Verify that the tang operator API has no high-risk security vulnerabilities
    by running Dynamic Application Security Testing (DAST) with RapiDAST and
    ZAP scanner deployed via Helm and analyzing the resulting security report.
contact: Patrik Koncity <pkoncity@redhat.com>
component:
  - tang
test: ./runtest.sh
recommend:
  - tang
  - helm
require+:
  - git
  - curl
  - jq
duration: 15m
enabled: true
tag:
  - NoRHEL6
  - NoRHEL7
  - NoRHEL8
  - Tier3
tier: '3'
adjust:
  - enabled: false
    when: distro < rhel-9
    continue: false
  - enabled: false
    when: distro == rhel-alt-7
    continue: false
id: 7af70378-3216-4f99-b3a0-17f3bbf49cf4
